{"EmbedController accepts embed_url without upfront sanitization, delegating validation to downstream URI parsing, and lacks DNS/IP-level SSRF protection": 0.7934661507606506, "EmbedController#ensure_embeddable validates referer host against SiteSetting.embeddable_host and raises Discourse::InvalidAccess if validation fails, but sets X-Frame-Options to ALLOWALL on success which may have security implications": 0.5436458587646484, "TopicEmbed.import_remote uses open(url).read to fetch remote content but never requires 'open-uri', causing a NoMethodError in environments where it isn't auto-loaded": 0.9221206307411194, "Template renders post content with raw post.cooked which bypasses Rails HTML escaping, allowing XSS if external content from RSS/Readability includes script tags or malicious markup": 0.8521093130111694, "Migration creates topic_embeds table with force: true which will drop the table if it already exists, risking data loss in existing environments": 0.8185608386993408}